ogue: 0,0:01:52.17,0:01:57.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! No wonder that straw hat looks familiar!Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.50,0:02:00.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, does it?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.15,0:02:05.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Inuarashi said that too! Do you all know Shanks?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:10.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, because both the cat and I were once traveling on Roger's ship.Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.00,0:02:15.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:17.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Were you guys the Pirate King's crewmembers?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:22.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Crewmembers... Well, you can put it that way too but...Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:27.37,Main,,0,0,0,,...we boarded many ships as Oden-sama's attendants.Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.37,0:02:30.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Even when we were traveling on Whitebeard's Moby Dick.Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.99,0:02:37.82,Main,,0,0,0,,And when Oden-sama was recruited by Roger, we were always by his side...Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:40.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait, wait! Whitebeard?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.87,0:02:47.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. We were still young...Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:53.23,Main,,0,0,0,,...just like the apprentices such as Shanks and Buggy.Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.23,0:02:55.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Stop! Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:59.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm completely lost! Um...Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:03.89,Main,,0,0,0,,But the two of us didn't go to Raftel with them.Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:06.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I said "Wait a minute"!Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:11.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, first, on Whitebeard's ship,Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:15.87,Main,,0,0,0,,there was Oden, the dog and the cat.Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.89,0:03:15.87,Captions,,496,0,300,,O D E NDialogue: 0,0:03:15.87,0:03:21.51,Main,,0,0,0,,And then Oden was recruited by Roger and you three switched to Roger's ship.Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:27.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember! We were having so much fun at that time!Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.41,0:03:37.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, the species, geographical features, and climates that I'd never seen!Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.06,0:03:40.08,Main,,0,0,0,,The sea of clouds in the sky!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.11,0:03:48.07,Main,,0,0,0,,The island that floats undersea! The sunlight!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:52.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Every day, I was very excited!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:55.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Those good old adventurous days!Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:03.61,Main,,0,0,0,,You two were trying to kill each other earlier, weren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:08.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, Kin'emon, were you guys traveling on Whitebeard's ship too?Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:10.85,Main,,0,0,0,,No, we stayed in the Wano Country the whole time.Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Instead, we were trying desperately to stop Oden-samaDialogue: 0,0:04:15.09,0:04:17.11,Main,,0,0,0,,from getting on board a pirate ship!Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:22.44,Main,,0,0,0,,In the closed-off nation, even leaving the country is a crime.Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:26.63,Main,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, Oden-sama was a hereticDialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:30.41,Main,,0,0,0,,who had doubts about the law of the country.Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.41,0:04:34.61,Main,,0,0,0,,We became acquainted with Whitebeard, Roger and theDialogue: 0,0:04:34.61,0:04:38.64,Main,,0,0,0,,others when they landed on the Wano Country.Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:42.30,Main,,0,0,0,,They were loyal to others and we didn't think they were particularly bad people.Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:48.69,Main,,0,0,0,,But I'd never heard of a daimyo getting aboard a pirate ship so as his retainer...Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.69,0:04:55.19,Main,,0,0,0,,So anyway, you all know Shanks! And Rayleigh as well?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:05:00.30,Main,,0,0,0,,If you got on board Roger's ship,Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:05.90,Main,,0,0,0,,it must've been the Oro Jackson which was built by my shipwright teacher Tom-san!Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:10.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you the shipwright Tom's pupil?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:15.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, can I go next? Then, I bet you know Crocus the ship doctor...Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:16.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Brook.Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:21.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt you. I gotta check something with them.Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.76,0:05:36.81,Main,,0,0,0,,You said the four Road Poneglyphs will show us the way to Raftel, right?Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.81,0:05:40.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to worry about the route.Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:41.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Look.Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:45.57,Main,,0,0,0,,The needles on the Log Pose!Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:51.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Normally, we choose our next destination looking at where these three needles pointDialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:54.62,Main,,0,0,0,,but we're not tracking them now. Is it okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:06:04.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We met Tra-guy-kun and came to Zou following the Vivre Card by chance,Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:09.97,Main,,0,0,0,,and found the Road Poneglyph which points the location of Raftel by by coincidence.Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:14.14,Main,,0,0,0,,But according to Crocus-san at the Twin Capes,Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.14,0:06:19.19,Main,,0,0,0,,if you track logs, every route will come to one in the end.Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:25.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd always imagined that's Raftel.Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:31.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Crocus! I haven't seen him for a long time!Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.35,0:06:33.39,Main,,0,0,0,,How is he doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:37.04,Main,,0,0,0,,He was fine! But that was two years ago!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:42.35,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean the old man who was with Laboon, right?Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.35,0:06:48.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Crocus the ship doctor! He-gara was looking for some pirate group back in those days.Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:51.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was my group - the whole crew is dead!Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:53.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:57.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Listen! I'm talking about something important!Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:07:00.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.31,0:07:04.56,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're interested where the logs will lead you, go see for yourself.Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:08.20,Main,,0,0,0,,There is definitely a route on which all of those three needles pointDialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:12.03,Main,,0,0,0,,in the same direction - towards one specific place.Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:21.86,Main,,0,0,0,,However, you-gara people have already left on a journeyDialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:25.19,Main,,0,0,0,,which lies beyond that point.Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.77,0:07:28.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What? What do you mean?Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:35.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to find out about something for the first time at the end of the route.Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.55,0:07:40.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Find out the truth about the Poneglyphs and the ancient script.Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Find out about the civilizationDialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:51.55,Main,,0,0,0,,that created those and the existence of the hidden last island Raftel!Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:08:01.59,Main,,0,0,0,,When Roger got there, he had to do everything all over again.Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:10.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Crocus was also part of the Pirate King's crew. He is one of those who know everything.Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.31,0:08:14.72,Main,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't tell a lie unless he doesn't like you-gara guys.Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:25.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I got it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.91,0:08:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't need to worry. We weren't wandering off of the route.Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:38.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I was just confused by the glimpses of the truth we hadn't yet discovered.Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:42.12,Main,,0,0,0,,The logs weren't lying!Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:46.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you a navigator? You're very dependable.Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:51.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! You're on the right track.Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:53.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Just keep going!Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.39,0:08:54.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:57.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! I don't know what you guys are talking aboutDialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:09:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,but don't you think our navigator's amazing?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:05.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I dependable? Yes, I'm sure I am!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:08.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! The navigator of the next Pirate King!Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:10.52,Main,,0,0,0,,How cool is that!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:14.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hit me! That hurts!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.59,0:09:23.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems you-gara guys have been having fun all this time.Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:32.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you guys are tied to so many legends andDialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:35.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel dizzy like when I met Rayleigh.Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:38.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I met Roger and the others tooDialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:42.30,Main,,0,0,0,,but I don't remember clearly because I was so young.Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:44.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you don't remember clearly...Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.30,0:09:48.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, no way! Roger died more than two decades ago!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:49.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.89,0:09:55.15,Main,,0,0,0,,So much happened on Oden-sama's journey.Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:57.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you all about it sometime.Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:04.34,Main,,0,0,0,,But for now, we have so many things to do before fighting Kaidou!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:07.11,Main,,0,0,0,,We need to prepare.Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.11,0:10:10.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Like I told you before, we're trying to recruit samuraiDialogue: 0,0:10:10.17,0:10:13.92,Main,,0,0,0,,who will fight with us in the Wano Country now!Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:18.18,Main,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, we've got someone we need to see!Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:21.70,Main,,0,0,0,,It's always good to have more reinforcements.Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:22.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is it?Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.57,0:10:27.39,Main,,0,0,0,,He is the former ıst division commander of the Whitebeard Pirates...Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:38.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Marco the Phoenix!Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.57,0:10:44.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Marco?Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.61,0:10:48.12,Main,,0,0,0,,--I didn't expect to hear that name here. --Marco... Marco...Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:52.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! So you guys are friendly with him! That's good to know!Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:58.38,Main,,0,0,0,,If he can back us up, that's going to be a tremendous help!Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.27,0:11:04.22,Main,,0,0,0,,No but wait a minute. In the event a year ago, they...Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, don't expect too much.Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if we can find him, there's only a little hope.Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:13.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Marco... Marco... I'm sure I know him...Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.85,0:11:18.84,Main,,0,0,0,,You must've met him in the Paramount War at Marineford!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Marco... Who was it?Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:24.58,Main,,0,0,0,,They say he ate a very rare type of Devil Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:26.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Rare?Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:29.79,Main,,0,0,0,,He looks like a pineapple.Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:33.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that guy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,It was a major clash between theDialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:37.90,Main,,0,0,0,,remnants of the Whitebeard Pirates led by MarcoDialogue: 0,0:11:37.90,0:11:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,and the Blackbeard Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:44.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been a year since the so-called Grudge War,Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:49.39,Main,,0,0,0,,but we haven't heard about what happened to the commanders yet.Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:55.75,Main,,0,0,0,,If he's alive, I think I know where he would be.Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:59.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa-whoa! Did they fight against Blackbeard?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,They did.Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:07.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Both sides had reinforcements. It was quite a large-scale battle.Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:22.72,Main,,0,0,0,,And Marco and the others suffered a crushing defeat.Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:29.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard came to be recognized as one of the Four Emperors after the war.Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:32.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that. Damn, Blackbeard!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:35.66,Main,,0,0,0,,That was a major incident!Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:37.98,Main,,0,0,0,,You really have no idea about what happened.Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:40.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe told me.Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.96,0:12:42.74,Main,,0,0,0,,In the Paramount War,Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:48.27,Main,,0,0,0,,after I passed out, the Whitebeard Pirates saved my life.Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:12:59.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,The war is not over yet!Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.45,0:13:03.88,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Take Ace's brother with you, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:07.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna see him again and thank him.Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:14.43,Main,,0,0,0,,So just like Kin'emon, we need time to prepare too.Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.43,0:13:17.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it! Then, let's split up for now!Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:23.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We will round up allies and plot a strategy in the Wano Country.Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:25.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna be okay there?Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:27.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you guys are being targeted by the shogun.Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:32.91,Main,,0,0,0,,But we're worried about our comrades there.Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:37.47,Main,,0,0,0,,If you come on our submarine, you'll be safe while traveling.Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.47,0:13:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.89,0:13:44.84,Main,,0,0,0,,...if you know a place to hide on the island, you'll be alright.Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:48.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go look for Marco with my subordinates.Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:51.97,Main,,0,0,0,,If Kin'emon and the others are headed there first,Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.97,0:13:55.20,Main,,0,0,0,,we'd better meet up in the Wano Country.Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:58.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's make Kin'emon's Vivre Card.Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:14:00.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, understood.Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:02.61,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is! Raizo-dono!Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.61,0:14:04.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Good to see you again!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:06.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:08.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're okay!Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:13.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Raizo-san!Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.24,0:14:17.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You guys...?Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:21.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's have a celebratory banquet.Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It's ready!Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:29.68,Main,,0,0,0,,A celebratory banquet? What are we celebrating?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:32.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Raizo-san's safety and...Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:37.28,Main,,0,0,0,,The reconciliation of the two kings and...Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:41.90,Main,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Clan for reuniting safely!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.40,0:14:43.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my!Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.61,0:14:48.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You damn Minks!Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:51.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry for locking you up!Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.53,0:14:54.95,Main,,0,0,0,,We wanted to save you-gara from Jack and the others!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:56.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Raizo-san!Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:59.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We tied up your hands - did we hurt you?Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:00.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Raizo-san!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:08.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Ninpo!Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:12.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I-love-you Technique!Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Raizo-dono!Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:20.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Raizo-dono!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.41,0:15:23.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Nin! Nin! Nin! Nin!Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:26.07,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's have a banquet!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:34.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Banquet! Banquet! Banquet! Banquet! Banquet!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.74,0:15:36.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Banquet! Banquet!Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:37.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:40.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We've already had a banquet!Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:44.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get going! It's gonna be too late to save Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.71,0:15:46.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you coming?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:51.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm coming with you! I feel responsible.Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:54.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, do you think you can travel the seaDialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:58.01,Main,,0,0,0,,of the New World without a navigator?Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:03.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm coming too! Pekoms is heavily injured!Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.72,0:16:06.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Plus,Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.77,0:16:13.76,Main,,0,0,0,,who is going to play music when you guys feel down?Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:22.00,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,,Let's go and meet Master NekomamushiDialogue: 0,0:16:20.69,0:16:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Who needs that?Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.00,0:16:25.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't exclude me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:29.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We both allowed them to take Sanji-san!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, do you mind if I take them with me?Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't need my permission! They're your crew!Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:41.52,Main,,0,0,0,,And no one can stop someone who is trying to save his friend!Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I wish I could come along!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.49,0:16:47.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm in debt to Sanji-dono!Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.77,0:16:49.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:53.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Now it's getting hard to sneak in.Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.53,0:16:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of there as soon as you screw up the wedding!Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.29,0:17:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go along with Kin'emon so you take care of Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:03.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Count on us!Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.97,0:17:05.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:10.71,Main,,0,0,0,,In case you find a Poneglyph, can you take a rubbing for me?Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:11.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:12.88,Main,,0,0,0,,So light-hearted!Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:18.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do research on the Poneglyph that Kaidou has in the Wano Country too.Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:18.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Great!Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:22.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! Is that all for now?Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:31.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm? What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:33.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:36.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:40.41,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:17:58.18,Main,,0,0,0,,The whole island is shaking!Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:05.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Zunesha is crying out!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.56,0:18:06.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:08.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's Zunesha?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:10.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're standing on it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:13.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's the elephant's name!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a big quake! It's never happened before!Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:31.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is it?! Whose voice is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:48.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Run! It's gonna collapse!Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:52.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Strong Right!Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Get away from the building!Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.58,0:19:01.74,Main,,0,0,0,,--Hold onto the tree! --Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:05.53,Main,,0,0,0,,This way!Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.55,0:19:09.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up now!Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:11.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:14.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is it?! Who's talking?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:24.56,Main,,0,0,0,,My bone's gonna break, break, break!Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:29.35,Main,,0,0,0,,My bones go crack, crack, crack, crack!Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.35,0:19:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama! Are you hurt?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.73,0:19:39.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What's happening to Zunesha?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.61,0:19:51.29,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If you're there...Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.60,0:19:54.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.56,0:19:58.13,Main,,0,0,0,,--I hear the voice again! --Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what's wrong?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:03.20,Main,,0,0,0,,"What's wrong"?! You hear it too, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:04.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Hear what?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.51,0:20:07.51,Main,,0,0,0,,--No way! --Can he-gara hear it too?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.51,0:20:10.75,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:13.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:16.77,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the loudest ever!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.77,0:20:18.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:30.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It's starting to work!Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:33.92,Main,,0,0,0,,No wonder.Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.70,0:20:38.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Normal elephants are panicked by just one bee.Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:42.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Take a good look at its body.Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:48.60,Main,,0,0,0,,If it's really been living for a millennium, its skin must've gotten weak!Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.60,0:21:00.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it a living legend? No! It's just an old animal!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:02.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Concentrate fire on its left foreleg!Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.16,0:21:08.74,Main,,0,0,0,,More volleys!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.47,0:21:24.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep shooting!Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.31,0:21:27.00,Main,,0,0,0,,If we can make it bend its knees and it brings its face closer,Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:29.64,Main,,0,0,0,,we can finish it off as we like!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:38.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd like to gouge its eyes out and cut out its tongue!Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:42.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can cut its stomach up from within!Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:48.91,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.41,0:21:51.58,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Give me an order!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.96,0:21:56.30,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If you are there!Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:59.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Give you an order to do what?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:02.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Answer me! Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:25.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't hear anything!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.60,0:22:27.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I can only hear his voice!Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.76,0:22:31.74,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not listening to me!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.39,0:22:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:39.48,Main,,0,0,0,,What is going on?Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:41.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Gol D. Roger...Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.96,0:22:44.20,Main,,0,0,0,,And Oden-sama as well.Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.20,0:22:46.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard they experienced the same thing.Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.92,0:22:51.66,Main,,0,0,0,,They heard a loud voice, but they couldn't get it to respond.Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:55.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama! Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:57.65,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:13.06,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this?Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.04,0:23:21.35,Main,,0,0,0,,My head! My head... h-hurts!Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.10,0:23:27.59,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...!Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.58,0:23:32.95,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Jack!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.51,0:23:36.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Jack is...Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.80,0:23:39.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Jack is attacking the elephant!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.48,0:23:45.92,Main,,0,0,0,,There are five powerful-looking ships at nine o'clock!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.92,0:23:48.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Zunesha is under attack?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.00,0:23:50.24,Main,,0,0,0,,As I thought, Jack wasn't dead.Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.64,0:23:53.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Momo! How do you know that?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.51,0:23:56.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know... I just saw it!Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.80,0:23:57.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You saw?Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.51,0:24:04.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It... It came to my mind...Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:06.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.48,0:24:09.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Send out the ships!Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.46,0:24:12.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Return fire against Jack on the water!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.09,0:24:13.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.20,0:24:23.73,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is painful!Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.22,0:24:29.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If I collapse,Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.15,0:24:34.16,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,it would put all of you in danger!Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.32,0:24:55.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The one behind the voice is...Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.43,0:24:58.35,Main,,0,0,0,,...this...Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.05,0:25:00.72,Main,,0,0,0,,...elephant!Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.37,0:25:04.85,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean Zunesha?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.85,0:25:07.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama! What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.20,0:25:09.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Again!Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.76,0:25:19.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,A long time ago, I...Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.79,0:25:26.42,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,A long time ago, the elephant committed a crime...Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.02,0:25:33.73,Main,,0,0,0,,And now... all he is allowed... to do is... walk.Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.73,0:25:38.05,Main,,0,0,0,,He has been... obeying that order.Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.31,0:25:44.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Thus...Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.83,0:25:59.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot it up! Blow it away!Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.20,0:26:07.46,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Thus, give me permission for once!Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.14,0:26:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,That worked! It's gonna collapse!Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.76,0:26:35.01,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Order me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.98,0:26:37.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,To fight!Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.60,0:26:40.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Momo!Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.34,0:26:45.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You tell him! I have a feeling that your voice will reach him!Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.07,0:26:46.04,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.44,0:26:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,If they bring down the elephant, we'll all end up in the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.25,0:26:53.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But how loud should I be...Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.08,0:26:56.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Just shout it out! Or the elephant will die!Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.04,0:27:10.77,Main,,0,0,0,,A little more to go!Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.66,0:27:21.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, elephant! You can't fall down!Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.68,0:27:24.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Make Jack...Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.13,0:27:34.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Make Jack go away!!Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.92,0:27:40.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Understood!Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.37,0:28:14.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Trunk!Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.08,0:28:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Jack-sama, our ship has been thrown into the air!Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.56,0:29:17.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh...Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.85,0:29:21.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no-saru!Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.19,0:29:57.18,Main,,0,0,0,,It quieted down.Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.18,0:29:58.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.81,0:30:04.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I don't see anything or hear the voice now.Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.41,0:30:13.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?! So Zunesha used his own trunk?Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.93,0:30:16.75,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right-saru! With a single blow!Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.75,0:30:22.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it. I'd never thought Zunesha had a mind of his own.Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.50,0:30:26.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, we can even communicate with him.Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.47,0:30:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Did Oden-sama know about Momonosuke-sama's ability?Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.42,0:30:33.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.70,0:30:36.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You guys still look serious.Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.69,0:30:39.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We're stunned at this sudden occurrence.Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.65,0:30:44.94,Main,,0,0,0,,First, we gotta find out how Jack was able to get here.Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.94,0:30:47.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, this place will no longer be safe.Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.90,0:30:53.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Well, good luck with that. It'd be cool if this elephant becomes our ally.Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.99,0:30:56.87,Main,,0,0,0,,That's easy for you to say.Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.87,0:31:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, we're gonna go, so can we have lots of food?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.98,0:31:12.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... Ring, ring, ring...Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.99,0:31:15.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring...Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.77,0:31:20.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... Ring, ring, ring...Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.98,0:31:22.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:25.19,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you want?Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.53,0:31:31.24,Main,,0,0,0,,They say that communication with Jack has been suddenly lost!Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.14,0:31:34.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Kaidou-san!Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.81,0:32:01.00,Main,,0,0,0,,The medical knowledge of the now-named Sakura Kingdom and the pharmaceutical knowledge of the Birdie Kingdom.Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.00,0:32:02.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It's really incredible!Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.98,0:32:05.49,Main,,0,0,0,,The bleeding has stopped.Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.49,0:32:07.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You did great!Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.50,0:32:11.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I prepared more than enough medicine, so you'll be okay!Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.32,0:32:13.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Only Dr. Chopper could've done it!Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.51,0:32:16.16,Main,,0,0,0,,It's really amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.16,0:32:18.99,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Such compliments...Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.99,0:32:22.53,Main,,0,0,0,,...don't make me happy, you fools!Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.59,0:32:27.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Like you taught us,Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.48,0:32:32.30,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll try to remove the bandages on a regular basis to see how the wound is.Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.30,0:32:37.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Good. But even just changing the bandages is painstaking.Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.46,0:32:40.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be careful.Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.02,0:32:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Leave it to us!Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.25,0:32:47.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Zunesha is our millennium-old land!Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.20,0:32:56.66,Main,,0,0,0,,We might've gotten too comfortable and forgotten about it because it's always been there since we were born.Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.66,0:33:01.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Today, we were reminded.Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.16,0:33:10.21,Main,,0,0,0,,We were reminded that we're always kept alive by this great lifeform.Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.56,0:33:16.51,Main,,0,0,0,,And it will come to an end one day.Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.51,0:33:22.44,Main,,0,0,0,,If Zunesha, our land, has free will,Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.44,0:33:25.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to ask him this now.Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.11,0:33:36.61,Main,,0,0,0,,"You have been walking for a thousand years. Where are you heading?"Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.91,0:33:44.68,Captions,,0,0,175,,Mokomo Dukedom, Kurau CityDialogue: 0,0:33:41.59,0:33:45.60,Main,,0,0,3,,You want to stay? Here in Zou?Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.60,0:33:46.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.80,0:33:48.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do here?Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.58,0:33:54.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I actually don't know what to do but...Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.33,0:33:57.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Understood!Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.40,0:34:03.02,Main,,0,0,0,,If it's possible, I want to talk with him once again!Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.82,0:34:07.02,Main,,0,0,0,,With Zunesha!Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.02,0:34:12.02,Main,,0,0,0,,With the one who has been living for a millennium!Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.02,0:34:16.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Why could he hear my voice?Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.23,0:34:22.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe he knows something about the Kozuki Clan!Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.08,0:34:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,--What? --Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.93,0:34:31.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand but there are people waiting for us in the Wano Country...Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.77,0:34:34.34,Main,,0,0,0,,That's all right, Kin'emon.Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.54,0:34:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking I still have to protect this country from the threat of Kaidou.Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.60,0:34:48.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't know yet how Jack could make it here twice so we mustn't let down our guard.Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.44,0:34:55.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't all get into the Wano Country at once anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.82,0:34:59.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I think I'll stay here for a while.Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.60,0:35:02.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll bring Momonosuke-sama with me later.Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.95,0:35:03.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Understood.Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.89,0:35:07.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Nekomamushi made my Vivre Card earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.93,0:35:10.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Give this to everyone.Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.12,0:35:14.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's split up into four groups.Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.06,0:35:19.23,Captions,,0,0,680,,Search for MarcoDialogue: 0,0:35:14.06,0:35:19.23,Captions,,860,0,530,,Wano CountryDialogue: 0,0:35:14.06,0:35:19.23,Captions,,0,0,3,,ZouDialogue: 0,0:35:14.06,0:35:19.23,Captions,,0,780,500,,Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:35:14.06,0:35:19.23,Captions,,40,0,515,,Team NekomamushiDialogue: 0,0:35:14.06,0:35:19.23,Captions,,950,0,100,,Team Kin'emonDialogue: 0,0:35:14.06,0:35:19.23,Captions,,0,0,95,,Team InuarashiDialogue: 0,0:35:14.06,0:35:19.23,Captions,,0,850,150,,Team LuffyDialogue: 0,0:35:19.22,0:35:23.41,Main,,0,0,0,,You can get there by following the Vivre Card,Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.41,0:35:26.36,Main,,0,0,0,,but the problem is how we communicate.Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.36,0:35:30.40,Main,,0,0,0,,In other countries, they use a snail to...Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.40,0:35:33.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's this big and if you speak into it, someone at a distance will...Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.94,0:35:36.94,Main,,0,0,0,,--Oh, you mean the Transponder Snail. --Oh, that.Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.94,0:35:41.16,Main,,0,0,0,,But in this country, we're not accustomed to using them.Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.16,0:35:44.99,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want a Transponder Snail, I saw a wild one in the forest.Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.00,0:35:50.90,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want one, I can set it up for you. It's easy.Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.90,0:35:51.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What??Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.49,0:35:54.08,Captions,,0,0,170,,Whale ForestDialogue: 0,0:35:51.95,0:35:54.08,Main,,0,0,3,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.57,0:35:56.88,Main,,0,0,3,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.13,0:35:56.44,Captions,,0,0,170,,The outskirts of the Guardians' dwellingDialogue: 0,0:35:58.35,0:36:02.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekomamushi's house is collapsed!Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.27,0:36:03.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pekomamushi!Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.13,0:36:07.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?! Answer me!Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.59,0:36:09.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekomamushi! Where are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.90,0:36:11.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.36,0:36:12.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.80,0:36:14.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Look down!Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.76,0:36:18.86,Main,,0,0,0,,A turtle?!Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.86,0:36:21.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Step back!Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.16,0:36:29.17,Main,,0,0,0,,How can I get a good rest?! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.17,0:36:32.08,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're Turtle-Mamushi!Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.08,0:36:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, so not only do you not remember my name, but you also forgot that I'm a lion! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.46,0:36:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, I could survive! I ate the Turtle Fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.00,0:36:46.30,Main,,0,0,0,,And my shell is as hard as a diamond!Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.30,0:36:48.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you listening?!Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.50,0:36:52.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper said he'll take responsibility for treating you.Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.18,0:36:57.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! You're not gonna respond to the diamond part? Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.94,0:36:59.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.54,0:37:02.99,Main,,0,0,0,,But I appreciate his care.Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.99,0:37:06.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I owe you guys a lot.Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.32,0:37:08.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.95,0:37:11.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!!Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.50,0:37:14.53,Main,,0,0,0,,So let's go see Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.53,0:37:17.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.17,0:37:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, you bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.30,0:37:24.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it? I'm fatally injured now!Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.93,0:37:31.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm injured! You've got to stop...Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.98,0:37:37.69,Main,,0,0,0,,It's insane! I can't believe this!Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.69,0:37:42.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the worst person to have debts to!Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.10,0:37:43.77,Captions,,930,0,300,,Guardians' Residential DistrictDialogue: 0,0:37:45.22,0:37:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Master.Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.65,0:37:48.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro.Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.88,0:37:50.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji saved this country.Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.51,0:37:57.12,Main,,0,0,0,,And he was kidnapped in this country.Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.12,0:38:00.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though the team has to be small, we will fail in our duty...Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.88,0:38:06.05,Main,,0,0,0,,...if no one from the Mink Tribe other than Pekoms accompanies them.Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.05,0:38:10.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You-gara, do you want to go along with Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.60,0:38:11.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I do!Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.53,0:38:14.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't try to get the jump on the rest, Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.18,0:38:16.87,Main,,0,0,0,,That is a role that...Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.52,0:38:25.07,Main,,0,0,0,,...we the Three Inuarashi Musketeers are prepared to take on!Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.07,0:38:27.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Back off, Shishilian!Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.53,0:38:31.94,Main,,0,0,0,,A noisy guy like you is the least suitable for the job!Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.57,0:38:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not noisy!Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.29,0:38:41.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go! I was with the Straw Hats the whole time!Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.04,0:38:44.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go too as an assistant to Dr. Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.34,0:38:45.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Wanda! Tristan!Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.85,0:38:49.89,Main,,0,0,0,,We befriended Luffy after we fought him, Pedro-san!Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.89,0:38:51.72,Main,,0,0,0,,BB! Roddy!Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.62,0:38:56.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami likes to sleep on my stomach!Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.61,0:38:58.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That won't do them any good, Pastor Yomo!Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.77,0:39:02.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna chew on Baron Corpse's bones forever!Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.87,0:39:04.89,Main,,0,0,0,,--Me too! --Me too!Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.89,0:39:08.32,Main,,0,0,0,,That's just your own goal! Shut up, dogs!Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.32,0:39:11.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand how you all feel!Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.37,0:39:13.60,Main,,0,0,0,,But you have to...Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.60,0:39:15.62,Main,,0,0,0,,...let Pedro handle it!Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:21.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Why, Master?!Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.96,0:39:24.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Because Pekoms will be there.Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.98,0:39:32.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Only Pedro can get him-gara under control!Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.72,0:39:40.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Something is going on over there.Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.85,0:39:45.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I called the last one "perfect" but...Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.82,0:39:50.15,Main,,0,0,0,,...the new one surpasses that easily!Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.15,0:39:53.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I incorporated the growth capability of Pop GreenDialogue: 0,0:39:53.41,0:39:57.49,Main,,0,0,0,,and got Franky's help for the surface treatment.Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.49,0:40:01.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not too much to say that it's the greatest invention of the century...Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.33,0:40:05.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You listening, Nami?!Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.75,0:40:07.96,Main,,0,0,0,,If I squeeze here...Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.79,0:40:18.85,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close!Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.27,0:40:23.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a little too long, Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.29,0:40:29.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen to my instruction! You extended it too far! You need some practice!Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.15,0:40:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a new Climate Baton which you can extend as you like with slight variations in handling!Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.69,0:40:39.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I see!Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.74,0:40:45.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I incorporated all the gadgets from Weatheria that I got from you at Sabaody.Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.15,0:40:49.85,Main,,0,0,0,,But just one thing...Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.80,0:40:54.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You said to me at Sabaody...Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.31,0:41:02.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's like a magic wand!Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.46,0:41:05.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't understand what it meant.Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.02,0:41:08.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It fits to my hand! It's easy to twirl!Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.30,0:41:11.41,Main,,0,0,0,,--So it's up to you to decide. --This is great, Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.41,0:41:15.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh... What an advanced ninjutsu that is!Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.40,0:41:17.65,Main,,0,0,0,,It's nice!Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.65,0:41:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,This sure is the culmination of Weatheria's science of weather!Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.10,0:41:24.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The Sorcerer's Climate Baton that I wanted!Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.62,0:41:26.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.59,0:41:28.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it!Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.25,0:41:30.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, about the cost...Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.23,0:41:32.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirage Tempo!Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.97,0:41:35.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't try to run!Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.36,0:41:37.66,Captions,,0,0,170,,The main gate of ZouDialogue: 0,0:41:39.22,0:41:42.24,Main,,0,0,0,,In the end, it's the six of us.Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.81,0:41:44.70,Main,,0,0,0,,It's nice to have you, Peropero!Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.70,0:41:46.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Pedro. I won't bother you.Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.23,0:41:51.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why's Big Bro Pedro coming, Grr?Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.11,0:41:55.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll come along as someone who's known you-gara well for a long time.Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.07,0:41:57.55,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.55,0:42:00.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! Take care!Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.82,0:42:04.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks! You too, Wanda!Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.86,0:42:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care, Dr. Chopper.Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.22,0:42:17.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen. We know him.Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.80,0:42:22.50,Main,,0,0,0,,He could be dancing around like that being happy about his marriage.Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.50,0:42:23.56,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.56,0:42:25.60,Main,,0,0,0,,But I can't deny it!Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.60,0:42:28.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it's gonna be okay!Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.44,0:42:32.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, Luffy-dono! We'll be waiting for you in the Wano Country!Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.82,0:42:34.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.40,0:42:37.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care!Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.74,0:42:42.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Let us know if something happens.Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.05,0:42:45.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make a weapon to destroy Kaidou!Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.80,0:42:50.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll round up the samurai in the Wano Country!Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.00,0:42:53.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll help you descend from the elephant.Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.67,0:42:56.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's okay, Kanjurou!Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.70,0:43:05.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Bye!Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.20,0:43:08.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Ya-hoo!Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.24,0:43:27.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave Sanji in our hands!Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.62,0:43:30.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.17,0:43:32.52,Main,,0,0,0,,See you in the Wano Country!Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.52,0:43:35.16,Main,,0,0,0,,--Okay! --Don't get caught by Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.16,0:43:37.63,Main,,0,0,0,,She's the emperor of the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.63,0:43:39.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! See you!Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.51,0:43:49.50,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Thus, the Sanji retrieval team led by Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.50,0:43:56.15,Narrator,,0,0,0,,...sets out for the Whole Cake Island where Emperor Big Mom, who Luffy picked a fight with, waits.Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.50,0:44:02.61,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, at the desert kingdom Alabasta in the Grand Line...Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.30,0:44:05.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Father-sama, hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.16,0:44:08.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, Vivi. Why are you in such a good mood?Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.64,0:44:23.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Because it's been a while since I went out to sea!Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.01,0:44:34.20,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Subtitling:  Galaxy 9000, Datenshi, Sewil  Quality Assurance:  Mr Luffy, Galaxy 9000, Feeso  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes and Titlecard:  Datenshi  Translation: Crunchyroll